WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.162
Ask Claude to review a
Deployment for OpenShift 4.22.

2
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:10.248
The kube-noob plugin runs on your machine.

3
00:00:10.248 --> 00:00:13.445
Claude calls its tools:
audit, fix and diagnose.

4
00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.807
kube-noob checks the
YAML against 77 rules and

5
00:00:19.807 --> 00:00:23.091
returns findings with
line numbers and fixes.

6
00:00:23.091 --> 00:00:24.770
Same answer every time.

7
00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.703
Each finding lands on its line.

8
00:00:31.703 --> 00:00:34.900
The safe fixes take the
score from 37 to 59,

9
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:38.751
and kube-noob lists the 4
changes that need a person.

10
00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:44.174
Claude explains the result in plain
language and cites the rule ids.

11
00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:53.494
There's no model inside kube-noob, and
it makes no network calls of its own.

12
00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:59.385
Add it to Claude Code with two commands.

13
00:00:59.385 --> 00:01:01.089
Get it at kube-noob dot com.
